StatusBar: keep its space while the pixmap is on its way

A later upstream change (0db509ea) hid the status bar without a pixmap. Ours arrives by an
async D-Bus call, so the first frames had no status bar and the page then jumped down 36 px.
PR1.3's components hide it only for showStatusBar: false, and it paints black until then.

--- a/src/meego/StatusBar.qml
+++ b/src/meego/StatusBar.qml
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@
     property bool __completed: false
 
     states: State {
-        name: "hide"; when: showStatusBar==false || statusBar.hasPixmap==false
+        name: "hide"; when: showStatusBar==false
         PropertyChanges { target: statusBar; anchors.topMargin: -statusBar.height; visible: false}
     }
 
